    <Description>Middleware for Azure Functions isolated worker using the ASP.NET Core integration HTTP model (ConfigureFunctionsWebApplication; HttpRequest/IActionResult triggers). Enforces [Authorize]/[AllowAnonymous] and exposes HttpContext.GetAuthenticatedUser().</Description>
